Subject: Welcome to Messora
Preheader: Your account is ready. Your first campaign is three steps away.

Messora
========================================

Hi Ayşe,

Your account is ready. Three steps are all it takes to get going:

1. Connect your WhatsApp number
   It takes a few minutes with your Meta account; your messages are sent from this number.
   https://acme.messora.tech/settings/whatsapp

2. Import your contacts
   Upload a CSV or Excel file and bring their consent status along.
   https://acme.messora.tech/contacts/import

3. Create your first campaign
   Pick an approved template, choose your audience, then send now or schedule it.
   https://acme.messora.tech/campaigns/new

Go to your dashboard: https://acme.messora.tech/

If you get stuck anywhere, our support team is happy to help.

